  "body": "Seen while writing providers-mask.test.cjs (Hide accounts on Providers), with Hide accounts off, on origin/main e085d6e92 in Playwright (chromium and webkit):\n\n1. Open Codex's editor on Providers.\n2. Type in the models filter, then clear it.\n3. Click Cancel: the dialog stays. A second click closes it.\n\nNot investigated yet. The new test works around it, so nothing red shows it.",
